Package: spark-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Massoud Mazar <massoud@localhost>
Depends: systemd
Section: net
Priority: optional
Description: Per-node metrics agent for spark-mini-dash
 Collects CPU, unified memory, GPU and thermal telemetry on this machine
 and serves it as JSON on :9105/metrics for the spark-mini-dash
 dashboard. Runs as a systemd service, enabled and started on install.
